OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of tenpin bowling alley
OL,4,Astab killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 29-year-old has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fkilling a man he stabbed in a
OL,8,Fconfrontation outside a tenpin bowling
OL,9,Falley after celebrating Valentine's
OL,10,FDay.
OL,12,FEllis Anim-Annor claimed he was acting
OL,13,Fin self-defence and to protect his
OL,14,Fgirlfriend when he fatally injured
OL,15,F22-year-old Lorik Abazi in Croydon,
OL,16,Fsouth London, in the early hours of 15
OL,17,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
