OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of tenpin bowling alley
OL,4,Astab killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors at the Old Bailey found
OL,7,FAnim-Annor guilty of manslaughter but
OL,8,Fcleared him of murder. He told his
OL,9,Ftrial that he wanted to put on a
OL,10,F"performance" for his girlfriend.
OL,12,FThe jury also acquitted Anim-Annor of
OL,13,Fwounding a second man with intent but
OL,14,Fconvicted him of the lesser offence of
OL,15,Funlawful wounding in a majority
OL,16,Fverdict.
